{
  "name": "CSP-Analyzer",
  "description": "A machine-learning desktop application for automated analysis of two-dimensional NMR spectra in fragment-based screening. It reads Bruker TopSpin peak lists, compares each experiment spectrum against a reference using computer-vision descriptors, and classifies spectra as active or inactive via a SMOTE-ENN, PCA and SVM pipeline. Cross-platform (.NET 8 / Avalonia) with a bundled Python backend; no separate Python install required.",
